#: ../../source/reference/cli.md:165
msgid ""
"The built-in examples are `cpu`, `cuda`, `npu`, `mlu`, and `musa`. Other "
"registered PyTorch device extensions may be used with their actual "
"backend name. An unavailable accelerator can trigger CPU fallback in the "
"non-calibrated execution path. Treat fallback as functional evidence, not"
" target-device performance evidence."
msgstr "The built-in 示例 are `cpu`， `cuda`， `npu`， `mlu`， and `musa`。 Other 注册的 PyTorch 设备 扩展 may be used with their actual 后端 name。 An unavailable accelerator can trigger CPU 回退 in the non-calibrated execution 路径。 Treat 回退 as 功能 证据， not 目标-设备 性能 证据。"

