msgid "Quantize examples"
msgstr "量化示例"

#: ../../source/reference/cli.md:202
msgid ""
"`inspect` reports recognized source formats, tensor groups, shapes, and "
"selection information. Use its JSON output when archiving an audit or "
"investigating an unfamiliar model."
msgstr "`inspect` 报告 已识别的 源 格式， tensor 组， 形状， and 选择 信息。 Use its JSON 输出 when archiving an audit or investigating an unfamiliar model。"

#: ../../source/reference/cli.md:211
msgid ""
"`validate` checks artifact structure and metadata. It does not prove "
"inference loading, accuracy, memory, throughput, or production readiness."
" See [output validation](../how-to/validate-outputs.md)."
msgstr "`validate` checks 产物 结构 and 元数据。 It does not prove 推理 加载， 精度， 内存， 吞吐量， or production readiness。 See [output validation](../how-to/validate-outputs.md)。"

